{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 的 S13 把“明知没人能保证永远、仍想听一句准话”改成“可就算听到了”，心理因果略显别扭，Y 在这层解释上更准确完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点词加亮，让观众不必逐字读完就能抓住每段情绪和叙事转折；感受文字较小，并且部分随音乐时点出现，减少了同时处理的信息，也让听觉和画面更容易对应。水面、船身、漂浮、失去支撑到最终停定的意象反复呼应，使整段心境有连续的推进，音乐感受也比 Y 更细致具体。Y 的优势是人物心理的因果解释更完整，但综合边听边扫、抓重点和感受音乐，我会选 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bf1db4ba-b00d-476d-bbbc-f60fa46a47ed", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022853143333Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:30:18.807260+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5cba422f660cd473d697d365a49c3fb38024a8451d9b0c1bff168db76b7ba949", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\